{"unit_id":"ExElectron__dsh-gov-portal#card-zh","repo":"ExElectron/dsh-gov-portal","commit":"04a69c142d6f308306f0797fb4bf2abac4cc691c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Gov Portal（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供独立的政务风办事大厅界面。它通过 Cordis 插件在宿主进程启动独立 Web 服务，并以 apiProxy 桥接会话和宿主设置。用户可发起和切换会话、选择模型与 Agent 模式、查看实时回执和工具轨迹、处理审批与系统提问、检索并导出会话卷宗，还可调整界面主题与宿主配置。适合希望在浏览器中使用 DSH 会话并查看执行过程的用户。无需额外 API Key；需运行 DSH web 宿主，默认监听 127.0.0.1:3081。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-9","lib/index.js:422-463","public/js/app.js:646-695","public/js/app.js:767-800","public/js/app.js:1262-1375"]}
{"unit_id":"ExElectron__dsh-gov-portal#card-en","repo":"ExElectron/dsh-gov-portal","commit":"04a69c142d6f308306f0797fb4bf2abac4cc691c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Gov Portal adds a browser workspace to DeepSeek Harness. It bridges host sessions through apiProxy. Users can create sessions, choose models, follow replies and tool events, handle approvals, search sessions, export logs, and adjust settings. Requires the DSH web host; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-9","lib/index.js:422-463","public/js/app.js:646-695","public/js/app.js:767-800","public/js/app.js:1262-1375"]}
