{"unit_id":"ExElectron__dsh-gov-portal#caveat-01","repo":"ExElectron/dsh-gov-portal","commit":"04a69c142d6f308306f0797fb4bf2abac4cc691c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Gov Portal 依赖 DSH web 宿主和 apiProxy 才能提供会话功能；缺少 apiProxy 时会尝试转发到默认主 GUI 地址 127.0.0.1:3080。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-9","lib/index.js:176-181"]}
{"unit_id":"ExElectron__dsh-gov-portal#caveat-02","repo":"ExElectron/dsh-gov-portal","commit":"04a69c142d6f308306f0797fb4bf2abac4cc691c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Gov Portal 默认绑定 127.0.0.1:3081；插件配置写入 ~/.dsh/gov-portal.json，浏览器界面配置保存在 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-47","lib/index.js:80-89","public/js/store.js:9-10","public/js/store.js:119-138"]}
{"unit_id":"ExElectron__dsh-gov-portal#caveat-03","repo":"ExElectron/dsh-gov-portal","commit":"04a69c142d6f308306f0797fb4bf2abac4cc691c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Gov Portal 不能脱离 DSH 宿主单独使用；卷宗删除动作调用 archiveSession，源码说明会话日志仍保留在宿主存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["public/js/app.js:1305-1344","public/js/app.js:647-662"]}
